### 1. Identified External Dependencies

Before refactoring, [`FleetCoreEngine`](https://github.com/jeremiahjmorris1126-coder/TRUCKWITHEASE-1/blob/main/server/fleetCore.ts) and the associated route handlers had direct coupling to several static calls, system environments, and hardware resources:

1. **Time / System Clock**: Direct static calls to `Date.now()` and `new Date().toISOString()`, preventing deterministic time-travel or deterministic token/audit test assertions.
2. **Entropy / Randomness / ID Generation**: Direct static calls to `Math.random()` and ad-hoc string formatting for driver IDs, tokens, audit IDs, and PINs.
3. **Data Stores / State (DB/Repository)**: Internal instantiation of `new Map()` with hardcoded seed data directly inside the constructor, preventing external database integration or lightweight test doubles.
4. **Hardware Telemetry Provider (Traxxas & J1939 ECU)**: In-memory simulation and static baud rate/latency assumptions coupled inside the engine.
5. **Static Configuration & Environmental Constants**: Hardcoded default driver IDs, vehicle dimensions (13' 6"), and FMCSA compliance defaults.

---

### 2. Introduced Abstractions & Interfaces

We introduced clean interfaces in [`server/fleetCore.ts`](https://github.com/jeremiahjmorris1126-coder/TRUCKWITHEASE-1/blob/main/server/fleetCore.ts):

```typescript
// System Clock Abstraction
export interface IClock {
  now(): number;
  toISOString(): string;
}

// Randomness & Identifier Generation Abstraction
export interface IRandomGenerator {
  random(): number;
  generateDriverId(name: string): string;
  generatePin(): string;
  generateTransponderId(): string;
  generateToken(driverId: string, timestamp: number): string;
  generateAuditId(timestamp: number): string;
}

// Driver Storage Repository
export interface IDriverRepository {
  getAll(): DriverAuthRecord[];
  getById(id: string): DriverAuthRecord | undefined;
  findByIdentifier(identifier: string): DriverAuthRecord | undefined;
  save(driver: DriverAuthRecord): void;
  count(): number;
}

// Modular Function & Feature Repository
export interface IFunctionCatalogRepository {
  getAll(): AppFunctionDefinition[];
  getById(id: string): AppFunctionDefinition | undefined;
  updateToggles(toggles: Record<string, boolean>): {
    activeFunctions: string[];
    disabledFunctions: string[];
  };
}

// Highway Restriction Engine (HRE) Route Repository
export interface IHreRestrictionRepository {
  getAll(): HreRestrictionRecord[];
  findByCorridor(corridor?: string): HreRestrictionRecord[];
}

// Traxxas Telemetry Provider
export interface ITraxxasTelemetryProvider {
  getTelemetry(jitter?: { speedDelta: number; rpmDelta: number; shock: number }): TraxxasTelemetryRecord;
  pushTelemetry(frame: Partial<TraxxasTelemetryRecord>, timestamp: string): TraxxasTelemetryRecord;
  ping(transponderId?: string, timestamp?: string, latencyMs?: number): TraxxasPingResponse;
  setTransponderId(id: string): void;
}

// Fleet Configuration Options
export interface IFleetConfiguration {
  defaultDriverId: string;
  standardTruckHeightFt: number;
  j1939BaudRateKbps: number;
  telemetrySamplingRateHz: number;
  defaultCarrierName: string;
  defaultUsdotNumber: string;
}
```

